Your input fields are:
1. `ticket` (str): Customer report
2. `previous_urgent` (Noul[(True, 'Service unavailable'), (False, 'Workaround available')]): Previous urgency
    Type description of Noul[(True, 'Service unavailable'), (False, 'Workaround available')]: A Boolean decision. Criteria: {"true": "Service unavailable", "false": "Workaround available"}.
3. `previous_category` (Choice[('billing', 'Payment issue'), ('technical', 'Product malfunction')]): Previous category
    Type description of Choice[('billing', 'Payment issue'), ('technical', 'Product malfunction')]: Select exactly one value. Options: [["billing", "Payment issue"], ["technical", "Product malfunction"]].
4. `previous_severity` (Score['Minor', 'Disruptive', 'Critical']): Previous severity
    Type description of Score['Minor', 'Disruptive', 'Critical']: Continuous score from 0 to 2; intermediate values are allowed. Rubric (level index, description): [[0, "Minor"], [1, "Disruptive"], [2, "Critical"]].
Your output fields are:
1. `urgent` (NoulEvidence): 
{
  "instructions": {
    "focus": "Current service availability"
  },
  "type": "noul",
  "criteria": {
    "true": "Service unavailable",
    "false": "Workaround available"
  }
}
2. `category` (ChoiceEvidence): 
{
  "instructions": "Which team should respond?",
  "type": "choice",
  "criteria": {
    "billing": "Payment issue",
    "technical": "Product malfunction"
  }
}
3. `severity` (ScoreEvidence): 
{
  "instructions": "How severe is the impact?",
  "type": "score",
  "criteria": [
    "Cosmetic",
    {
      "what": "Work interrupted"
    },
    {
      "examples": [
        "Complete outage"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
4. `native_urgent` (bool): Is immediate action needed?
5. `native_category` (Literal['billing', 'technical']): Which team should respond?
6. `annotated_urgent` (NoulEvidence): 
{
  "instructions": "Is immediate action needed?",
  "type": "noul",
  "criteria": {
    "true": "Service unavailable",
    "false": "Workaround available"
  }
}
    Type description of Noul[(True, 'Service unavailable'), (False, 'Workaround available')]: A Boolean decision. Criteria: {"true": "Service unavailable", "false": "Workaround available"}.
7. `annotated_category` (ChoiceEvidence): 
{
  "instructions": "Which team should respond?",
  "type": "choice",
  "criteria": {
    "billing": "Payment issue",
    "technical": "Product malfunction"
  }
}
    Type description of Choice[('billing', 'Payment issue'), ('technical', 'Product malfunction')]: Select exactly one value. Options: [["billing", "Payment issue"], ["technical", "Product malfunction"]].
All interactions will be structured in the following way, with the appropriate values filled in.

[[ ## ticket ## ]]
{ticket}

[[ ## previous_urgent ## ]]
{previous_urgent}

[[ ## previous_category ## ]]
{previous_category}

[[ ## previous_severity ## ]]
{previous_severity}

[[ ## urgent ## ]]
{urgent}        # note: the value you produce must adhere to the JSON schema: {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"noul": {"type": "number", "description": "Probability that the answer is true.", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "title": "Noul"}}, "required": ["noul"], "title": "NoulEvidence"}

[[ ## category ## ]]
{category}        # note: the value you produce must adhere to the JSON schema: {"type": "object", "$defs": {"ChoiceProbabilities": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"billing": {"type": "number", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "title": "Billing"}, "technical": {"type": "number", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "title": "Technical"}}, "required": ["billing", "technical"], "title": "ChoiceProbabilities"}}, "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"confidence": {"type": "number", "description": "Confidence in the decision, from 0 to 1.", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "title": "Confidence"}, "probabilities": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ChoiceProbabilities", "description": "Probability of each option; sum to one."}}, "required": ["probabilities", "confidence"], "title": "ChoiceEvidence"}

[[ ## severity ## ]]
{severity}        # note: the value you produce must adhere to the JSON schema: {"type": "object", "$defs": {"ScoreProbabilities": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"0": {"type": "number", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "title": "0"}, "1": {"type": "number", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "title": "1"}, "2": {"type": "number", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "title": "2"}}, "required": ["0", "1", "2"], "title": "ScoreProbabilities"}}, "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"confidence": {"type": "number", "description": "Confidence in the decision, from 0 to 1.", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "title": "Confidence"}, "probabilities": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ScoreProbabilities", "description": "Probability of each option; sum to one."}}, "required": ["probabilities", "confidence"], "title": "ScoreEvidence"}

[[ ## native_urgent ## ]]
{native_urgent}        # note: the value you produce must be True or False

[[ ## native_category ## ]]
{native_category}        # note: the value you produce must exactly match (no extra characters) one of: billing; technical

[[ ## annotated_urgent ## ]]
{annotated_urgent}        # note: the value you produce must adhere to the JSON schema: {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"noul": {"type": "number", "description": "Probability that the answer is true.", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "title": "Noul"}}, "required": ["noul"], "title": "NoulEvidence"}

[[ ## annotated_category ## ]]
{annotated_category}        # note: the value you produce must adhere to the JSON schema: {"type": "object", "$defs": {"ChoiceProbabilities": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"billing": {"type": "number", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "title": "Billing"}, "technical": {"type": "number", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "title": "Technical"}}, "required": ["billing", "technical"], "title": "ChoiceProbabilities"}}, "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"confidence": {"type": "number", "description": "Confidence in the decision, from 0 to 1.", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "title": "Confidence"}, "probabilities": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ChoiceProbabilities", "description": "Probability of each option; sum to one."}}, "required": ["probabilities", "confidence"], "title": "ChoiceEvidence"}

[[ ## completed ## ]]
